This repository contains Nix packaging for OpenCode Desktop (flake.nix,
package.nix, update scripts, GitHub Actions, and related files). That
packaging is licensed under the MIT License below.

This repository does **not** include OpenCode Desktop. The flake only records
official download URLs and hashes; Nix fetches the Linux AppImage at build
time.

OpenCode is MIT-licensed open source software, published by Anomaly. The
AppImage also bundles Electron and Chromium, under their own licenses, which
ship inside the download. This project is unofficial and is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anomaly.

